<title>USA: SportsLine USA files for initial public offering.</title>
<headline>SportsLine USA files for initial public offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>SportsLine USA Inc, which runs a sports news and information site on the Internet with CBS, on Wednesday filed to sell shares through an initial public offering on the Nasdaq.</p>
<p>The company's site on the Internet's World Wide Web provides sports news and scores, radio shows, profiles of athletes, editorials and analyses, contests, games and fantasy leagues. It covers college and profession sports in the United States and other countries. The site also offers sports merchandise.</p>
</text>
